 "summary": "A single NPN silicon transistor in the three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount package, rated 60 V collector to emitter, 80 V collector to base and 1.0 A collector current, with 250 mW dissipation. DC current gain is 100 to 300 at 1 mA and at 500 mA, 80 to 300 at 1.0 A and 30 to 300 at 2.0 A, and the collector-emitter saturation voltage is at most 0.5 V at 1 A with 100 mA base drive. Transition frequency is at least 150 MHz.",
